    "# 04 A/B Test Statistical Analysis\n",
    "\n",
    "## Vanguard Digital Experiment\n",
    "\n",
    "### Purpose\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook evaluates whether Vanguard's redesigned digital experience improved client behavior compared with the existing Control experience.\n",
    "\n",
    "The analysis uses the validated client level datasets prepared in the previous notebooks.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Statistical Analysis\n",
    "\n",
    "The notebook evaluates:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. Client completion rate\n",
    "2. Client completion time\n",
    "3. Client Step Back behavior\n",
    "\n",
    "For each research question, the analysis will include:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. Research question\n",
    "2. Null and alternative hypotheses\n",
    "3. Appropriate statistical test\n",
    "4. Significance level\n",
    "5. Descriptive statistics\n",
    "6. Assumption checks\n",
    "7. Test statistic and p value\n",
    "8. Critical values and rejection regions\n",
    "9. Statistical decision\n",
    "10. Effect size\n",
    "11. Confidence interval where appropriate\n",
    "12. Business interpretation\n",
    "\n",
    "### Significance Level\n",
    "\n",
    "Alpha = 0.05\n",
    "\n",
    "The direction of each statistical test will be determined by the corresponding research hypothesis."
   ]
