    "\n",
    "**one row, one observation, regardless of how many journeys that client made.**\n",
    "\n",
    "### Two questions per KPI, in this order:\n",
    "\n",
    "**1.** could the difference be only chance?\n",
    "\n",
    "**2.** is it large enough for Vanguard to act on?"
