   "source": [
    "Decision Framework\n",
    "\n",
    "The deployment decision combines evidence from the previous research questions across five key areas:\n",
    "| Decision Area                      | Evidence                                                                                       | Assessment |\n",
    "| ---------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------- |\n",
    "| **User Experience**                | Overall behavior indicates both efficiency gains and signs of additional navigation friction   | Mixed      |\n",
    "| **Overall Completion Rate**        | Test increased completion from **65.59% to 69.29%**                                            | Positive   |\n",
    "| **Process Completion Time**        | Test reduced median completion time from **4.52 to 3.95 minutes**                              | Positive   |\n",
    "| **Navigation Behavior**            | Step Back rate increased from **26.10% to 33.41%**, and Step Back frequency was higher in Test | Concern    |\n",
    "| **Stage Level Funnel Performance** | Strong improvement at **start to step 1**, but significant decline at **step 1 to step 2**     | Mixed      |\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "The new design should be recommended only if the overall benefits are meaningful and the identified weaknesses do not outweigh those improvements.\n",
    "\n",
    "Decision\n",
    "\n",
    "Recommend optimization and retesting before full deployment.\n",
    "\n",
    "Business Interpretation\n",
    "\n",
    "The redesigned experience produced meaningful benefits in completion rate and completion speed, showing that more clients successfully completed the process and did so faster.\n",
    "\n",
    "However, the redesign also increased Step Back behavior and introduced a statistically significant deterioration at the step 1 to step 2 transition.\n",
    "\n",
    "The evidence therefore supports the potential of the new design, but not an unconditional full deployment in its current form.\n",
    "\n",
    "Final Recommendation\n",
    "\n",
    "Retain the successful elements of the redesign, investigate the navigation friction and step 1 to step 2 transition, optimize these areas, and conduct another A B test before full deployment."
   ]
